{
  "sourceId": "post-The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone-zh-TW",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在 iOS 中模擬網路延遲甚至不良網路條件非常簡單。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您不需要設定代理、路由器或不良的網路提供商。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您所要做的就是使用 Xcode 啟用開發者模式。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然後，您可以看到**開發者**圖示，它允許您輕鬆模擬各種網路場景。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在開發者下，您可以看到 **Network Link Conditioner**。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "預設情況下它是*關閉*的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "點擊 **Network Link Conditioner**，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有幾個設定檔供您使用。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以利用從您的手機到目標後端的 **ping** 時間（往返），然後減去從實驗室後端的 **ping** 時間。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "要建立新的設定檔，只需點擊 **Add a profile...**↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "假設 ping 時間為 900ms，您可以設定 **Out Delay**、**In Delay** 或兩者。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "***",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone",
        "title": "在 iPhone 上對應用程式執行網路延遲測試的最簡單方法",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-easiest-way-to-perform-network-latency-test-on-an-App-in-iPhone/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "完成！",
